  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting the Protection of Children, Adolescents and Young People in Northern Mozambique</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the programme is to promote protection of children, adolescents and young people (CAYP) in northern Mozambique through community engagement (using the socio-ecological model), access to services, and monitoring and reporting of grave violations against children.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
